WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.601
Shelfmark keeps every link you save in one place.

2
00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:06.518
Open the demo: no account needed.

3
00:00:06.518 --> 00:00:09.905
Paste a link.

4
00:00:09.905 --> 00:00:18.002
The preview fills in by itself.

5
00:00:18.002 --> 00:00:20.214
Put it in a folder…

6
00:00:20.214 --> 00:00:22.932
…and give it a tag.

7
00:00:22.932 --> 00:00:27.346
Save it, and it lands on your shelf.

8
00:00:27.346 --> 00:00:31.772
Folders and tags keep the shelf in order.

9
00:00:31.772 --> 00:00:41.002
A tag gathers its links from every folder.

10
00:00:41.002 --> 00:00:42.187
Need it again? Tap Search.

11
00:00:42.187 --> 00:00:47.343
Search finds titles, notes, folders and tags.

12
00:00:47.343 --> 00:00:50.844
Shelfmark. Every link, back within reach.
